---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Projects">

  <div class="hero-wrap">
    <div class="glow"></div>


    <!-- ===== Carousel ===== -->
    <div class="carousel-wrap">
    <p class="section-label">Portfolio</p>
    <h1>Selected Projects</h1>
    <section class="carousel" aria-label="Featured projects">
      <div class="slides" id="slides">

        <article class="slide" aria-roledescription="slide">
          <div class="slide-inner">
            <div class="slide-text">
              <h2>Master's Thesis: Learnable Dynamic Voltage Optimization in Radios</h2>
              <p>My MSc thesis at Ericsson and Chalmers focused on predicting and adapting 5G radio power consumption using machine learning. The goal was to minimize energy usage without degrading network performance.</p>
              <div class="slide-cta">
                <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/MastersThesis_DynamicVoltageOptimization.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Thesis</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="slide-art" style="--bg-img: url('/assets/mastersthesis.jpg');" role="img" aria-label="Master's Thesis"></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="slide" aria-roledescription="slide">
          <div class="slide-inner">
            <div class="slide-text">
              <h2>Bachelor's Thesis: Accessible Board Game Playing</h2>
              <p>My BSc thesis focused on making board games more accessible for people with visual impairment. We developed a camera + image recognition system that converted physical cards into a digital hand, tested on Catan with high recognition accuracy.</p>
              <div class="slide-cta">
                <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/AccessibleCardPresentationInBoardGames.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Report</a>
                <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wVrZ3TUVwXZCaCIZuLXTU6MWxHNr-Nfm/view?usp=share_link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch Video</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="slide-art" style="--bg-img: url('/assets/catan3.jpg');" role="img" aria-label="Bachelor's Thesis"></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="slide" aria-roledescription="slide">
          <div class="slide-inner">
            <div class="slide-text">
              <h2>LLM Assistant for Skincare Web Application</h2>
              <p>Developed a language model-based assistant for a skincare web application, integrated with product data to provide personalized recommendations. Runs Llama 3 locally through Ollama with simple memory functionality.</p>
              <div class="slide-cta">
                <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/ai-skincare-shopping-assistant" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
                <button class="btn open-skincare-demo" type="button">Demo Video</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="slide-art" style="--bg-img: url('/assets/skincareAssistant.png');" role="img" aria-label="LLM Skincare Assistant"></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="slide" aria-roledescription="slide">
          <div class="slide-inner">
            <div class="slide-text">
              <h2>Sparse Matrix Optimization with Meta-Learning</h2>
              <p>Extends WACO with meta-learning to adapt across hardware with minimal data. On 300 samples from a new machine, our meta-trained model outperformed the original WACO.</p>
              <div class="slide-cta">
                <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/WACO_Meta_Learning_SpMM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
                <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/WACO_WITH_META_LEARNING.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Article</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="slide-art" style="--bg-img: url('/assets/WACO.png');" role="img" aria-label="Sparse Matrix Optimization"></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="slide" aria-roledescription="slide">
          <div class="slide-inner">
            <div class="slide-text">
              <h2>Detection of Melanoma in Images</h2>
              <p>Transfer learning with ConvNeXT for dermoscopy images. Best model reached 0.88 accuracy on the test set.</p>
              <div class="slide-cta">
                <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/Melanoma_detection.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
                <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/Melanoma_detection.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Article</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="slide-art" style="--bg-img: url('/assets/melanoma.png');" role="img" aria-label="Melanoma Detection"></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="slide" aria-roledescription="slide">
          <div class="slide-inner">
            <div class="slide-text">
              <h2>Advanced RAG for Financial QA</h2>
              <p>Built on the ARKMan architecture with hybrid search, reasoning chains, and query decomposition using FinQA data.</p>
              <div class="slide-cta">
                <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/Advanced_RAG_Financial_QA.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
                <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/Final_Project_Prompt_Eng.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Report</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="slide-art" style="--bg-img: url('/assets/ARKMan.png');" role="img" aria-label="Advanced RAG Financial QA"></div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>

      <div class="carousel-controls" aria-hidden="false">
        <button class="control" id="prev" aria-label="Previous slide">&#9664;</button>
        <button class="control" id="next" aria-label="Next slide">&#9654;</button>
      </div>
      <div class="dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose slide">
        <button class="dot" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-current="true"></button>
        <button class="dot" role="tab" aria-selected="false"></button>
        <button class="dot" role="tab" aria-selected="false"></button>
        <button class="dot" role="tab" aria-selected="false"></button>
        <button class="dot" role="tab" aria-selected="false"></button>
        <button class="dot" role="tab" aria-selected="false"></button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

    <!-- ===== Projects + Sidebar ===== -->
    <div class="projects-wrap">
      <nav class="projects-nav" aria-label="Project navigation">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#proj-masters">MSc Thesis</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-bachelors">BSc Thesis</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-skincare">LLM Skincare</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-waco">Sparse Matrix</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-melanoma">Melanoma</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-rag">RAG Llama-2</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-finrag">Financial RAG</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-lda">Topic Modeling</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-trees">Tree Classification</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-energy">Energy Optimization</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-lora">LoRA vs FE</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-covid">COVID Comments</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-ttt">Tic-Tac-Toe RL</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-netflix">Netflix Recs</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-ngram">N-Gram Nobel</a></li>
          <li><a href="#proj-ibm">IBM Translation</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <section class="projects-list">

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-masters">
        <p class="section-label">MSc Thesis</p>
        <h3>Master's Thesis: Dynamic Voltage Optimization in Radios</h3>
        <p>Combined classification and regression models with traffic-aware thresholds to reduce power consumption while maintaining performance. Included explainability using SHAP values.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/MastersThesis_DynamicVoltageOptimization.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Thesis</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-bachelors">
        <p class="section-label">BSc Thesis</p>
        <h3>Bachelor's Thesis: Accessible Board Game Playing</h3>
        <p>Making board games more accessible for people with visual impairment via camera + image recognition, converting physical cards into a digital hand. Tested on Catan with high accuracy.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/AccessibleCardPresentationInBoardGames.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Report</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wVrZ3TUVwXZCaCIZuLXTU6MWxHNr-Nfm/view?usp=share_link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Video</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-skincare">
        <p class="section-label">LLM Application</p>
        <h3>LLM Assistant for Skincare Web Application</h3>
        <p>Skincare web app with an integrated LLM assistant running Llama 3 locally through Ollama, with simple memory functionality and a REST API connecting three components.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/ai-skincare-shopping-assistant" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
          <button class="btn open-skincare-demo" type="button">Demo Video</button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-waco">
        <p class="section-label">Meta-Learning</p>
        <h3>Sparse Matrix Optimization with Meta-Learning</h3>
        <p>Extends WACO with meta-learning to adapt across hardware with minimal data. On 300 samples from a new machine, our meta-trained model outperformed the original WACO.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/WACO_Meta_Learning_SpMM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/WACO_WITH_META_LEARNING.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Article</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-melanoma">
        <p class="section-label">Computer Vision</p>
        <h3>Detection of Melanoma in Images</h3>
        <p>Transfer learning with ConvNeXT for dermoscopy images. Best model reached 0.88 accuracy on the test set.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/Melanoma_detection.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/Melanoma_detection.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Article</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-rag">
        <p class="section-label">RAG</p>
        <h3>Question Answering RAG with Llama-2 and Mistral</h3>
        <p>RAG pipeline using Pinecone vector DB. Best config: e5-base + Mistral, beating GPT-3.5-turbo on this dataset.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/rikardradovac/RAG.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/RAG_mistral_llama2.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Article</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-finrag">
        <p class="section-label">RAG</p>
        <h3>Advanced RAG for Financial QA</h3>
        <p>Financial QA using ARKMan, hybrid search, chain-of-thought, and query decomposition on the FinQA dataset.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/Advanced_RAG_Financial_QA.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/Final_Project_Prompt_Eng.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Group Report</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/10m02d3GYGIeA7wRREcrvoYSSJ7rRpePl/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Group Video</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-V-PDJY2puYrXNohVTKTjC0wY-SCairb/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Individual Video</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-lda">
        <p class="section-label">NLP</p>
        <h3>Topic Modeling Using LDA with Collapsed Gibbs Sampling</h3>
        <p>3000 docs from 20 Newsgroups. Best coherence with 10 topics and α = β = 0.1.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/Topic_modeling_LDA.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/Topic_modeling.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Article</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-trees">
        <p class="section-label">Computer Vision</p>
        <h3>Image Classification of Trees from Bark</h3>
        <p>CNN for 12 species from bark images. Ablation study highlights: residuals, normalization, batch norm. Added OOD vs ID task (100% on that split).</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/TreeClassification.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/ImageClassificationTrees.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Article</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-energy">
        <p class="section-label">Optimization</p>
        <h3>Non-Linear Energy Optimization in Network</h3>
        <p>11-node grid model minimizing generation cost while meeting demand. Best found cost: 186.29 SEK.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/Planning_of_electricity_production_and_transmission-1.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Article</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-lora">
        <p class="section-label">Fine-tuning</p>
        <h3>LoRA vs Feature Extraction</h3>
        <p>Comparing LoRA with feature extraction for task adaptation. LoRA achieved Acc/F1 ≈ 0.93 vs 0.81.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/Comparsion_LoRA_FT.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/LoRA.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Report</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-covid">
        <p class="section-label">NLP</p>
        <h3>Classifying Pro/Anti COVID-19 Vaccine Comments</h3>
        <p>Best baseline: Logistic Regression + TF-IDF (Acc 0.89) on annotated social media comments.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/Covid_comment_classification.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/Document_classifier_covid.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Report</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-ttt">
        <p class="section-label">Reinforcement Learning</p>
        <h3>Reinforcement Learning for Tic-Tac-Toe</h3>
        <p>MCTS with UCT. Win rate: 0.86 vs random; 0.83 vs blocking strategy.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/RL_tic_tac_toe.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/annotated-Module6Group60-1.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Report</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-netflix">
        <p class="section-label">Recommendation</p>
        <h3>Recommendation System for Netflix Movies</h3>
        <p>Hybrid preferences using prior ratings, genres, and similar users.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/annotated-DAT410__Assignment_2.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Report</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-ngram">
        <p class="section-label">NLP</p>
        <h3>N-Gram Model: Nobel Prize Motivations</h3>
        <p>Deterministic bigram per category achieved highest semantic similarity (0.56) and strong BLEU on this dataset.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/Nobel_prize_winner_motivations.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/annotated-Module8Group60.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Report</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" id="proj-ibm">
        <p class="section-label">NLP</p>
        <h3>IBM Translation Model</h3>
        <p>IBM Model 1 on parallel EN-SV-DE-FR corpus.</p>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="links">
          <a class="btn btn-project1" href="https://github.com/cecnyb/IBM_translation_model.git" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-project2" href="https://cecnyb.github.io/articles/annotated-Module5Goup60.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Report</a>
        </div>
      </article>

    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- ===== Video Modal ===== -->
  <div class="video-modal" id="skincare-demo-modal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="video-modal-backdrop" id="close-skincare-demo-backdrop"></div>
    <div class="video-modal-content" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Skincare assistant demo video">
      <button class="video-modal-close" type="button" id="close-skincare-demo">×</button>
      <video id="skincare-demo-video" controls preload="metadata">
        <source src="/assets/AgentRecommendation.webm" type="video/webm">
        Your browser does not support the video tag.
      </video>
    </div>
  </div>

  

</Layout>

<style>
  .glow {
    position: absolute;
    width: 500px;
    height: 500px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(150,109,17,0.08) 0%, transparent 65%);
    top: -100px;
    right: -60px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-wrap { position: relative; }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: rgba(255, 254, 252, 0.8);
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }

  /* ===== Carousel ===== */
  .carousel-wrap {
    padding-left: 0px;
  }
  .carousel {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--card-border);
    background: rgba(188, 220, 242, 0.26);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(196,160,80,0.06);
  }
  .slides {
    display: flex;
    transition: transform .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.1,1);
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .slide {
    min-width: 100%;
    padding: 36px 32px;
  }
  .slide-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .slide-text h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: rgba(255, 254, 252, 0.8);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .slide-text p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .slide-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .slide-art {
    height: 260px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.2);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    background-image:
      var(--bg-img),
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(21,48,72,0.8), rgba(10,10,10,0.9));
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
  }
  .control {
    pointer-events: auto;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.25);
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    margin: 0 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: rgba(196,160,80,0.8);
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .control:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
  .carousel-controls {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .dots {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 12px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.2);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .dot[aria-current="true"] {
    background: var(--gold-soft);
    border-color: var(--gold);
  }

  /* ====Project Nav === */
  /* ===== Projects layout with sidebar ===== */
.projects-wrap {
  margin-top: 60px;
}
.projects-nav {
  position: fixed;
  top: 80px;
  left: 20px;
  width: 180px;
  padding: 20px 16px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
  border: 0.5px solid rgba(196,160,80,0.15);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  z-index: 10;
  max-height: calc(100vh - 100px);
  overflow-y: auto;
}

.projects-nav .section-label {
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.projects-nav ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 2px;
}

.projects-nav ul li a {
  display: block;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
  text-decoration: none;
  padding: 6px 10px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  transition: color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.projects-nav ul li a:hover {
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
}

.projects-nav ul li a.active {
  color: var(--gold-soft);
  background: rgba(150,109,17,0.12);
  border-left: 2px solid var(--gold-soft);
  padding-left: 8px;
}

.projects-list {
  display: grid;
  gap: 20px;
  padding-left: 0px;
}

@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .projects-wrap {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  .projects-nav {
    display: none;
  }
}

  /* ===== Projects List ===== */
  .projects-list {
  display: grid;
  gap: 0px;
  padding-left: 0px;
  padding-top: 100px;
}
.project-card {
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 0;
  padding: 28px 28px;
  box-shadow: none;
  backdrop-filter: none;
  margin-bottom: 60px;
  scroll-margin-top: 40vh;


  /* Default state — pushed back */
  opacity: 0.35;
  transform: scale(0.95) translateY(8px);
  transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease, border-color 0.2s;
  transform-origin: center center;
}

.project-card.in-focus {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: scale(1.02) translateY(0);
}

.project-card.out-focus {
  opacity: 0.35;
  transform: scale(0.95) translateY(8px);
}

.project-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88);
  margin: 0 0 20px;
  text-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
}

.project-card p {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.42);
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin: 0;
  font-weight: 300;
  text-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
}

.project-card:hover {
  border-bottom-color: rgba(196,160,80,0.25);
}
  .divider {
    height: 0.5px;
    background: rgba(196,160,80,0.12);
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  /* ===== Video Modal ===== */
  .video-modal {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 9999;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .video-modal.is-open { display: flex; }
  .video-modal-backdrop {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.75);
  }
  .video-modal-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: min(900px, 95vw);
